## emulator ensure
USAGE: grantiva emulator ensure [--json] [--verbose] [--quiet] [--name <name>] [--system-image <system-image>] [--boot] [--no-boot] [--headless]  OPTIONS:  --json Output as JSON  --headless Boot without a window. GRANTIVA_EMULATOR_HEADLESS=1  or CI=true does the same; otherwise the emulator gets  a window, even when stdout is not a terminal. 
